{
  "info": {
    "name": "Bookstore Inventory API",
    "description": "Colección Postman para API de inventario de librería.\n\nLas respuestas de éxito devuelven el valor directamente, sin envoltorio. Los errores devuelven `{ code, message, additionalInfo? }`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "b00k5t0r3-1nv3nt0ry-4p1-0001"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL base de la API."
    },
    {
      "key": "bookId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id numérico de un libro existente."
    },
    {
      "key": "page",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Número de página para listados paginados."
    },
    {
      "key": "limit",
      "value": "10",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Tamaño de página para listados paginados."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Books",
      "description": "Recurso Book.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create book",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n  \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n  \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n  \"supplierCountry\": \"US\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["books"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un libro en el inventario.\n\n**Body**\n- `title` (string, requerido)\n- `author` (string, requerido)\n- `isbn` (string, requerido): único, no puede repetirse\n- `costUsd` (number, requerido): máximo 2 decimales, no negativo\n- `stockQuantity` (entero, requerido): no negativo\n- `category` (string, requerido)\n- `supplierCountry` (string, requerido)\n\nLos campos no listados se ignoran.\n\n**Respuestas**\n- `201 Created`: `{ id }` del libro creado.\n- `400 BAD_REQUEST`: body inválido.\n- `400 BOOK-E-001`: ya existe un libro con ese ISBN."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n  \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n  \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n  \"supplierCountry\": \"US\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["books"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": 1\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 ISBN duplicado",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n  \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n  \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n  \"supplierCountry\": \"US\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["books"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"BOOK-E-001\",\n  \"message\": \"A book with that ISBN code already exists\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Find many books",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["books"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "{{page}}" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "{{limit}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista los libros del inventario, paginados.\n\n**Parámetros (query, opcionales)**\n- `page` (entero, ≥ 1): número de página. Default `1`.\n- `limit` (entero, ≥ 1): tamaño de página. Default `10`.\n\n**Respuestas**\n- `200 OK`: `{ books, total, page, limit }`. `books` es la lista de libros de esa página (puede venir vacía); `total` es la cantidad total de libros en el inventario.\n- `400 BAD_REQUEST`: `page` o `limit` no son enteros ≥ 1."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books?page={{page}}&limit={{limit}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["books"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "page", "value": "{{page}}" },
                    { "key": "limit", "value": "{{limit}}" }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"books\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n      \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n      \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n      \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n      \"sellingPriceLocal\": null,\n      \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n      \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n      \"supplierCountry\": \"US\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 1,\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 10\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Find one book",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["books", "{{bookId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene un libro por su id.\n\n**Parámetros**\n- `id` (path, entero, requerido): id del libro.\n\n**Respuestas**\n- `200 OK`: el libro completo (`id`, `title`, `author`, `isbn`, `costUsd`, `sellingPriceLocal`, `stockQuantity`, `category`, `supplierCountry`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`).\n- `400 BAD_REQUEST`: el id no es un entero.\n- `404 BOOK-E-002`: no existe un libro con ese id.\n\n`sellingPriceLocal` es `null` hasta que se calcula el precio de venta."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["books", "{{bookId}}"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"The Pragmatic Programmer\",\n  \"author\": \"David Thomas\",\n  \"isbn\": \"978-0135957059\",\n  \"costUsd\": 34.99,\n  \"sellingPriceLocal\": null,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 12,\n  \"category\": \"Software Engineering\",\n  \"supplierCountry\": \"US\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Libro inexistente",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/books/999",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["books", "999"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"code\": \"BOOK-E-002\",\n  \"message\": \"The book does not exist\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
